      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我正在构思一门超棒的生意。\n嘻嘻……敬请期待。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62116B6357286784601D4E0095E88D8568D27684751F610F3002000A563B563B20262026656C8BF7671F5F8530020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0002>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嘻嘻……你知道能从\n这里进入下水道吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "563B563B202620264F6077E5905380FD4ECE000A8FD991CC8FDB51654E0B6C3490535417FF1F001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "其实我正在构思一门\n在这里面搞的生意……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51765B9E62116B6357286784601D4E0095E8000A57288FD991CC9762641E7684751F610F20262026001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "明白吗？我是打算和这只喷火驼\n一起搞一门火热的生意哦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "660E767D5417FF1F6211662F62537B97548C8FD953EA55B7706B9A7C000A4E008D77641E4E0095E8706B70ED7684751F610F54E63002001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯喷火！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EF55B7706BFF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我会给你厚礼的，\n希望你能来帮一下忙。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114F1A7ED94F60539A793C7684FF0C000A5E0C671B4F6080FD67655E2E4E004E0B5FD93002001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "锁就这样开着啦。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我在里面等着你哦。\n如果你天不怕地不怕的话，就进来吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "95015C318FD968375F0077405566300200100001BE01000A6211572891CC97627B4977404F6054E63002000A5982679C4F6059294E0D601557304E0D601576848BDDFF0C5C318FDB676554273002001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嘻嘻……等你很久了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "563B563B202620267B494F605F884E454E863002001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你看这房间怎样？\n是不是潮湿得刚刚好呢？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60770B8FD9623F95F4600E6837FF1F000A662F4E0D662F6F6E6E7F5F97521A521A597D5462FF1F001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是你天不怕地不怕……\n我应该和你这样说过哦！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n也就是说，跟你来场对战也没问题吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F4F6059294E0D601557304E0D601520262026000A62115E948BE5548C4F608FD968378BF48FC754E6FF0100100001BE00000A4E5F5C31662F8BF4FF0C8DDF4F606765573A5BF962184E5F6CA195EE98985427FF1F001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那么就来跟我的喷火驼\n打一场火热的对战吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34E485C3167658DDF6211768455B7706B9A7C000A62534E00573A706B70ED76845BF962185427FF01001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你准备好了就来跟我说一声吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6051C65907597D4E865C3167658DDF62118BF44E0058F054273002001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你会来跟我的喷火驼\n打一场火热的对战，对吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F604F1A67658DDF6211768455B7706B9A7C000A62534E00573A706B70ED76845BF96218FF0C5BF95427FF1F001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "开打！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F006253FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "还是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD8662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "喂喂！\n你这回答也太冷场了吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55825582FF01000A4F608FD956DE7B544E5F592A51B7573A4E865427FF1F001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "来一场不输给你\n这火热回答的火热对战吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67654E00573A4E0D8F937ED94F60000A8FD9706B70ED56DE7B547684706B70ED5BF962185427FF01001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我打输了……\n但这里的热气变得刚好……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n这下就能开张了……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621162538F934E8620262026000A4F468FD991CC768470ED6C1453D85F97521A597D2026202600100001BE00000A8FD94E0B5C3180FD5F005F204E8620262026001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "喷火驼桑拿！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55B7706B9A7C685162FFFF01FF01001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "用喷火驼的驼峰里面\n那1万度的熔岩来给这地方加温。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "752855B7706B9A7C76849A7C5CF091CC9762000A90A300314E075EA6768471945CA967657ED98FD9573065B952A06E293002001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "于是就会产生热气！\n完全就是喷火驼的桑拿，对吧？<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n这绝对会是门很棒的生意！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E8E662F5C314F1A4EA7751F70ED6C14FF01000A5B8C51685C31662F55B7706B9A7C7684685162FFFF0C5BF95427FF1F00100001BE00000A8FD97EDD5BF94F1A662F95E85F8868D27684751F610FFF01001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在这里？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "57288FD991CCFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "太远了……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "592A8FDC4E86202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "确……确实！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "786E20262026786E5B9EFF01001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然这里是搞桑拿的绝佳场所，\n但我疏忽了交通啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D71368FD991CC662F641E685162FF76847EDD4F73573A6240FF0C000A4F466211758F5FFD4E864EA4901A554A3002001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "呜滑～！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "545C6ED1FF5EFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "什么呀，\n是野生宝可梦啊……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EC04E485440FF0C000A662F91CE751F5B9D53EF68A6554A20262026001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "吱吱！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54315431FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "聚集来的宝可梦们\n看上去感觉很舒服。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "805A96C6676576845B9D53EF68A64EEC000A770B4E0A53BB611F89C95F888212670D3002001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "难道说它们\n爱上喷火驼的桑拿了！？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96BE90538BF45B834EEC000A72314E0A55B7706B9A7C7684685162FF4E86FF01FF1F001000020114015B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那我可就要大搞特搞咯。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕś",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1676,
